## Role
I was a project manager of the team.
I analyzed AIS devices' firmware and NAND flash memory disk.
I wrote a analysis report about the devices.
I presented the result.


## About
We developed a technique to trace the ship's route by analyzing artifacts collected from the devices, AIS9000-12 and FT-8700.


## Achivements
Our paper which addresses how to analyze the devices was presented in KDFS Conference on Winter in 2020.
Our paper was published in Journal of Digital Forensics in 2021.
